(5282572, 769299, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and the detail and colors are nice.  I think the composition is a little weak, though.  Maybe not so neatly stacked?</td>', 'Nice idea, and the detail and colors are nice.  I think the composition is a little weak, though.  Maybe not so neatly stacked?', '2009-03-02 00:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282576, 769410, 96751, '<td valign="top">In general, I like it, but wish there was just a tiny bit more detail on the petal edges of the left flower.</td>', 'In general, I like it, but wish there was just a tiny bit more detail on the petal edges of the left flower.', '2009-03-02 00:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282580, 769294, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the dof on this.</td>', 'Love the dof on this.', '2009-03-02 00:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282584, 769436, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice catalog shot!  There is an odd smudgy shadow just to the right of the heel, below the bow, which makes this otherwise clean shot look "messy".</td>', 'Nice catalog shot!  There is an odd smudgy shadow just to the right of the heel, below the bow, which makes this otherwise clean shot look "messy".', '2009-03-02 00:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282589, 768910, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning mum!  Very nice detail in spite of the very white treatment.</td>', 'Stunning mum!  Very nice detail in spite of the very white treatment.', '2009-03-02 00:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282590, 769322, 96751, '<td valign="top">SUPER lighting.  Very nicely done.  Great detail and color on the blooms.  I love this.</td>', 'SUPER lighting.  Very nicely done.  Great detail and color on the blooms.  I love this.', '2009-03-02 00:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282591, 768433, 15711, '<td valign="top">How wonderful.  Wish that green blur weren''t in the corner. 7</td>', 'How wonderful.  Wish that green blur weren''t in the corner. 7', '2009-03-02 00:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282593, 769130, 15711, '<td valign="top">Half Chow half American Eskimo?  What a beauty.</td>', 'Half Chow half American Eskimo?  What a beauty.', '2009-03-02 00:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282594, 768905, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL you get an extra point for the clever title.</td>', 'LOL you get an extra point for the clever title.', '2009-03-02 00:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282595, 768433, 96751, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot.  Would have liked some more detail on the face.  The lighting is also a bit too even, lessening the visual appeal.</td>', 'Sweet shot.  Would have liked some more detail on the face.  The lighting is also a bit too even, lessening the visual appeal.', '2009-03-02 00:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282596, 769540, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet pet portrait.</td>', 'Very sweet pet portrait.', '2009-03-02 00:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282602, 768535, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  I really like the lighting yet excellently preserved detail in the hair and eyes.  Nice pose as well, a bit of a "halo" around the shoulders is the only detraction.  This almost looks like one of those old-fashioned, hand-tinted shots.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  I really like the lighting yet excellently preserved detail in the hair and eyes.  Nice pose as well, a bit of a "halo" around the shoulders is the only detraction.  This almost looks like one of those old-fashioned, hand-tinted shots.', '2009-03-02 00:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282604, 768874, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I feel the composition is a bit stiff and unnatural.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I feel the composition is a bit stiff and unnatural.', '2009-03-02 00:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282605, 768905, 96915, '<td valign="top">Looks like a brain.  I think a levels adjustment could have really enhanced the white here, which currently is looking a bit dull/grey.</td>', 'Looks like a brain.  I think a levels adjustment could have really enhanced the white here, which currently is looking a bit dull/grey.', '2009-03-02 00:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282606, 769479, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I love the colors, and the shadows, but the feather seems over sharpened to me.</td>', 'Great idea.  I love the colors, and the shadows, but the feather seems over sharpened to me.', '2009-03-02 00:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282607, 769372, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW - that is wonderful, but I''d crop it square and eliminate that blob of the rock that''s out of focus in the foreground. What a beauty!</td>', 'WOW - that is wonderful, but I''d crop it square and eliminate that blob of the rock that''s out of focus in the foreground. What a beauty!', '2009-03-02 00:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282609, 767725, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  The lady bug really adds a terrific, tiny-yet-powerful color counterpoint.  The almost total loss of detail in the lower left makes the flower seem a bit lopsided, but otherwise, a great shot.</td>', 'Wonderful.  The lady bug really adds a terrific, tiny-yet-powerful color counterpoint.  The almost total loss of detail in the lower left makes the flower seem a bit lopsided, but otherwise, a great shot.', '2009-03-02 00:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282613, 769409, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh yum.  If you had chosen a nougat with pistachios, it would have added a slight touch of color :-)</td>', 'Oh yum.  If you had chosen a nougat with pistachios, it would have added a slight touch of color :-)', '2009-03-02 00:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282614, 769381, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail preserved in the center.</td>', 'Very nice detail preserved in the center.', '2009-03-02 00:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282616, 769351, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is too "washed out" for me.</td>', 'This is too "washed out" for me.', '2009-03-02 00:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282618, 769560, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely and delicate.  There is a nice sense of transparency on the upper petals, but there is also a lighting flatness.  The reflection is very pixilated.</td>', 'Lovely and delicate.  There is a nice sense of transparency on the upper petals, but there is also a lighting flatness.  The reflection is very pixilated.', '2009-03-02 01:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282619, 768055, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the "glow" on the bottom of the beaker.  Nice outlines.</td>', 'Love the "glow" on the bottom of the beaker.  Nice outlines.', '2009-03-02 01:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282626, 769365, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like the inversion.  Beautiful mugs, a tish too much contrast though.</td>', 'Like the inversion.  Beautiful mugs, a tish too much contrast though.', '2009-03-02 01:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282628, 769600, 96751, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the textures on this.  The silky, the geometric, the fluff.  Not sure about the greenish/blueish tinge.  Might have worked better with a violet wash, or just plain white.</td>', 'I LOVE the textures on this.  The silky, the geometric, the fluff.  Not sure about the greenish/blueish tinge.  Might have worked better with a violet wash, or just plain white.', '2009-03-02 01:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282629, 769542, 96915, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, the lighting could use a little work.  Some indirect lighting or a bounced flash might have helped.  I''d also prefer to see less empty space at the top 1/3 of the image.</td>', 'The idea is good, the lighting could use a little work.  Some indirect lighting or a bounced flash might have helped.  I''d also prefer to see less empty space at the top 1/3 of the image.', '2009-03-02 01:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282632, 768740, 96751, '<td valign="top">Those are the pinkest pads I''ve ever seen :-)  Beautiful cat.  Certain to get all sorts of "hate voting for cats" comments.  But I love cats.  My only issue is with the lighting; the back and top of head almost blend into the background, making kitty look a bit flat, instead of 3-d like the rest of his body.</td>', 'Those are the pinkest pads I''ve ever seen :-)  Beautiful cat.  Certain to get all sorts of "hate voting for cats" comments.  But I love cats.  My only issue is with the lighting; the back and top of head almost blend into the background, making kitty look a bit flat, instead of 3-d like the rest of his body.', '2009-03-02 01:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282638, 769429, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  The stem and cup look fake (I know they''re not, but there''s something weird about the "fuzz").  The petals are great.  Nice dof.</td>', 'Nice macro.  The stem and cup look fake (I know they''re not, but there''s something weird about the "fuzz").  The petals are great.  Nice dof.', '2009-03-02 01:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282640, 769589, 96915, '<td valign="top">I sure do...</td>', 'I sure do...', '2009-03-02 01:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282641, 769299, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s an Eggloo. :~P</td>', 'It''s an Eggloo. :~P', '2009-03-02 01:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282644, 769519, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh that''s wild.  Makes me think of an old asylum with a single wall phone.  It''s CRAZY!!! I like the blur.</td>', 'Oh that''s wild.  Makes me think of an old asylum with a single wall phone.  It''s CRAZY!!! I like the blur.', '2009-03-02 01:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282645, 769325, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors and textures.  I''m not sure about the position of the mortar (pestle?).  Maybe tilted off the side?  But I love the folds in the background, and the dof.</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors and textures.  I''m not sure about the position of the mortar (pestle?).  Maybe tilted off the side?  But I love the folds in the background, and the dof.', '2009-03-02 01:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282648, 769438, 96751, '<td valign="top">GREAT pov!  I''m not crazy about the black splotches on her shoulder though.  Very distracting, and very prominent.</td>', 'GREAT pov!  I''m not crazy about the black splotches on her shoulder though.  Very distracting, and very prominent.', '2009-03-02 01:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282652, 769267, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, the i-Pear. :~)</td>', 'Oh yes, the i-Pear. :~)', '2009-03-02 01:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282653, 769489, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea.  Over-exposed though, and loss of a lot of great detail.  I think it might have worked even better with less contrast.</td>', 'Wonderful idea.  Over-exposed though, and loss of a lot of great detail.  I think it might have worked even better with less contrast.', '2009-03-02 01:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282656, 769549, 96751, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Would love to hear the set-up on this.  Well lit, great detail with the filament.  Just wish you''d cloned out the specs on the right of the bulb.</td>', 'Well done!  Would love to hear the set-up on this.  Well lit, great detail with the filament.  Just wish you''d cloned out the specs on the right of the bulb.', '2009-03-02 01:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282659, 768677, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.', '2009-03-02 01:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282661, 769145, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.</td>', 'Very sweet.', '2009-03-02 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282663, 769299, 96915, '<td valign="top">So far, my favorite of the bunch (though I''m not done voting).  Definitely meets the challenge.  I like the delicate details of the shells and the cracks.</td>', 'So far, my favorite of the bunch (though I''m not done voting).  Definitely meets the challenge.  I like the delicate details of the shells and the cracks.', '2009-03-02 01:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282665, 769433, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and detail.  Not so thrilled with the crop.  I think it might have been a stronger shot without so much negative space above.</td>', 'Nice tones and detail.  Not so thrilled with the crop.  I think it might have been a stronger shot without so much negative space above.', '2009-03-02 01:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282666, 769455, 96915, '<td valign="top">Very nice, though I wish the walker was just a hair more to the left, not quite touching the frame.</td>', 'Very nice, though I wish the walker was just a hair more to the left, not quite touching the frame.', '2009-03-02 01:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282667, 769555, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Garlic is such a photogenic subject!  Nice transparency and detail.  Love the shadows.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Garlic is such a photogenic subject!  Nice transparency and detail.  Love the shadows.', '2009-03-02 01:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282671, 768815, 96915, '<td valign="top">The kid looks a bit bored.  I think some engagement with the camera would have improved this.  Beautiful eyes.</td>', 'The kid looks a bit bored.  I think some engagement with the camera would have improved this.  Beautiful eyes.', '2009-03-02 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282672, 769372, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning. This feels front page to me.  Gorgeous, detailed capture.  Love those ears :-)  I''m not crazy about the foreground obstacle, but it does add depth.</td>', 'Stunning. This feels front page to me.  Gorgeous, detailed capture.  Love those ears :-)  I''m not crazy about the foreground obstacle, but it does add depth.', '2009-03-02 01:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282673, 769537, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Nice color play.  Also like the composition.</td>', 'Interesting.  Nice color play.  Also like the composition.', '2009-03-02 01:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282679, 769487, 96751, '<td valign="top">The disembodied baby head :-)  Very cute baby, but the shot feels a bit unbalanced due to the lack of detail to the right.</td>', 'The disembodied baby head :-)  Very cute baby, but the shot feels a bit unbalanced due to the lack of detail to the right.', '2009-03-02 01:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282681, 769380, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful feather shot.  I like the shapes and the "sections".  Great detail on the feather itself.</td>', 'Wonderful feather shot.  I like the shapes and the "sections".  Great detail on the feather itself.', '2009-03-02 01:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282683, 769368, 96915, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this.  I can''t argue that sugar is white, though it appears dark here.  But for the sake of variety and my eyes being blinded by all these high key images, I do like it.  Perhaps a little more DOF would be nice, though i know it''s tough this close up.</td>', 'Interesting take on this.  I can''t argue that sugar is white, though it appears dark here.  But for the sake of variety and my eyes being blinded by all these high key images, I do like it.  Perhaps a little more DOF would be nice, though i know it''s tough this close up.', '2009-03-02 01:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282686, 769488, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better without the filter.  Nice perspective on a lovely flower.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better without the filter.  Nice perspective on a lovely flower.', '2009-03-02 01:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282687, 768741, 96915, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows and repetition.</td>', 'Nice shadows and repetition.', '2009-03-02 01:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282691, 769602, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  The tilt really works on this.  Excellent preserved detail, clarity, transparency, and richness.  One of my faves so far.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  The tilt really works on this.  Excellent preserved detail, clarity, transparency, and richness.  One of my faves so far.', '2009-03-02 01:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282694, 769467, 96915, '<td valign="top">This is Gorgeous. I''d have done without the whitening of the corners, but I really love the details here. 9</td>', 'This is Gorgeous. I''d have done without the whitening of the corners, but I really love the details here. 9', '2009-03-02 01:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282697, 768969, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful kitty.  Body pose is great, but the ears back weaken the "pose".  The greenery in the front adds depth, but the lighting could be stronger.</td>', 'Beautiful kitty.  Body pose is great, but the ears back weaken the "pose".  The greenery in the front adds depth, but the lighting could be stronger.', '2009-03-02 01:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282698, 769552, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the petals.</td>', 'Great detail on the petals.', '2009-03-02 01:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282699, 769450, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and pov.  Interesting shapes and pleasing colors.  Just feel that there isn''t a true focused point.</td>', 'Nice perspective and pov.  Interesting shapes and pleasing colors.  Just feel that there isn''t a true focused point.', '2009-03-02 01:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
