(5282729, 769529, 96915, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that it took me several looks to connect the batman spotlight with the "light" in the challenge.  So now that I get it, it''s more interesting to me, but still not very visually appealing to my tastes.</td>', 'I have to admit that it took me several looks to connect the batman spotlight with the "light" in the challenge.  So now that I get it, it''s more interesting to me, but still not very visually appealing to my tastes.', '2009-03-02 01:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
