(5283644, 768496, 36981, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose &amp; the expression on her face; the whiteness of it all is beautiful.  I find the stick/cane a little jarring; it doesn''t seem to match the elegance of the rest of the image (not that that''s bad, it''s just confusing for me.)</td>', 'I really like the pose & the expression on her face; the whiteness of it all is beautiful.  I find the stick/cane a little jarring; it doesn''t seem to match the elegance of the rest of the image (not that that''s bad, it''s just confusing for me.)', '2009-03-02 12:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
