(5283657, 769601, 36981, '<td valign="top">A beautiful mom-to-be - I really like this one.  I especially like the choice of pink for the fabric - I''ve seen so many like this with white that it''s a nice change, and the pink is pretty with her skin tones &amp; dark hair.  Her left had is the only element that bothers a little - the extreme light there makes it look somehow wrong to me.</td>', 'A beautiful mom-to-be - I really like this one.  I especially like the choice of pink for the fabric - I''ve seen so many like this with white that it''s a nice change, and the pink is pretty with her skin tones & dark hair.  Her left had is the only element that bothers a little - the extreme light there makes it look somehow wrong to me.', '2009-03-02 12:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
