(5283895, 768850, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is so soft, it''s very elegant and I like it a lot. I love the way the flower curves and I think it''s a great specimen.</td>', 'This is so soft, it''s very elegant and I like it a lot. I love the way the flower curves and I think it''s a great specimen.', '2009-03-02 13:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283899, 769204, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the dof and the colors here, they really pop. But I think that the full-size copy (compared to the thumbnail) isn''t as polished as I expected it to be. The green pacifier is rougher/has more imperfections than I expected and I think it would be a stronger image if it were smoother.</td>', 'I love the dof and the colors here, they really pop. But I think that the full-size copy (compared to the thumbnail) isn''t as polished as I expected it to be. The green pacifier is rougher/has more imperfections than I expected and I think it would be a stronger image if it were smoother.', '2009-03-02 13:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283902, 769603, 98141, '<td valign="top">They eyes pop and are really nice, great exposure for this challenge and nice composition.</td>', 'They eyes pop and are really nice, great exposure for this challenge and nice composition.', '2009-03-02 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283903, 769255, 98141, '<td valign="top">Aw, what a cutie :) I like this photo, but I wish his eyes were lighter (not that there''s anything you could do about that) because I think if the irises stood out more from the dark fur around his eyes it would really pop. As is, I like it. I think a little more space between his nose and the crop would be nice.</td>', 'Aw, what a cutie :) I like this photo, but I wish his eyes were lighter (not that there''s anything you could do about that) because I think if the irises stood out more from the dark fur around his eyes it would really pop. As is, I like it. I think a little more space between his nose and the crop would be nice.', '2009-03-02 13:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283907, 769296, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is lacking a sharpness that I think would really make that DOF breathtaking. I like the composition, the subject, the colors... I just wish that shell that is the focus were sharper.</td>', 'This is lacking a sharpness that I think would really make that DOF breathtaking. I like the composition, the subject, the colors... I just wish that shell that is the focus were sharper.', '2009-03-02 13:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283909, 769470, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think if you were to include the bottom of the glass in the shot, that would be good. I like the sense of motion with this. Looks very creamy.</td>', 'I think if you were to include the bottom of the glass in the shot, that would be good. I like the sense of motion with this. Looks very creamy.', '2009-03-02 13:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
