(5283913, 769540, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, I think the exposure is done very well and that they eye stands out so nicely against the light fur. Great composition.</td>', 'I love this picture, I think the exposure is done very well and that they eye stands out so nicely against the light fur. Great composition.', '2009-03-02 13:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283917, 769601, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the softness in this, the femininity of it. I think it''s a really nice pose for this kind of pic. I like the clothing choice too - maintains the soft, feminine feel of the pic.</td>', 'I like the softness in this, the femininity of it. I think it''s a really nice pose for this kind of pic. I like the clothing choice too - maintains the soft, feminine feel of the pic.', '2009-03-02 13:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
