(5295859, 769579, 102315, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the rice be more defined where it meets the background.</td>', 'I would have preferred the rice be more defined where it meets the background.', '2009-03-08 14:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295860, 769603, 102315, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait.</td>', 'I like this portrait.', '2009-03-08 14:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295861, 769482, 102315, '<td valign="top">I see the look that you are going for but would prefer a tad bit more focus on the pills further back.</td>', 'I see the look that you are going for but would prefer a tad bit more focus on the pills further back.', '2009-03-08 14:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295862, 769337, 102315, '<td valign="top">I like this one.</td>', 'I like this one.', '2009-03-08 14:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295864, 769555, 102315, '<td valign="top">Like the capture and the title. Brings everything together nicely.</td>', 'Like the capture and the title. Brings everything together nicely.', '2009-03-08 14:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295866, 769600, 102315, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I see what you are trying to convey with "gently bleeding" but am curious to what exactly that solid white blob is?</td>', 'Great composition. I see what you are trying to convey with "gently bleeding" but am curious to what exactly that solid white blob is?', '2009-03-08 14:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295868, 769552, 102315, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful flower.</td>', 'This is a beautiful flower.', '2009-03-08 14:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295869, 769260, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo. Looks like he just shot a basketball. :)</td>', 'Very cute photo. Looks like he just shot a basketball. :)', '2009-03-08 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295870, 769044, 102315, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower. The definition between the white flower and the white background makes this photo work for me in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful flower. The definition between the white flower and the white background makes this photo work for me in this challenge.', '2009-03-08 14:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295874, 769546, 102315, '<td valign="top">The subject does not do it for me, but the capture itself is good.</td>', 'The subject does not do it for me, but the capture itself is good.', '2009-03-08 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295875, 769267, 102315, '<td valign="top">Without the title I would have been a little confused. The title bumps your score higher for me. Not many cases were I feel this way, but this is an exception.</td>', 'Without the title I would have been a little confused. The title bumps your score higher for me. Not many cases were I feel this way, but this is an exception.', '2009-03-08 14:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295879, 769486, 102315, '<td valign="top">Good capture of motion and portraying what you mean in your title.</td>', 'Good capture of motion and portraying what you mean in your title.', '2009-03-08 14:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295885, 768988, 102315, '<td valign="top">Yes it is rice. I can''t tell if it''s the focus or the processing, but I would have preferred the subject of the photo to be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Yes it is rice. I can''t tell if it''s the focus or the processing, but I would have preferred the subject of the photo to be a bit sharper.', '2009-03-08 14:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295886, 769351, 102315, '<td valign="top">I''m hungry now. Like the details and the tomatoes make this one pop a little more than it would have without them.</td>', 'I''m hungry now. Like the details and the tomatoes make this one pop a little more than it would have without them.', '2009-03-08 14:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295892, 768910, 102315, '<td valign="top">There is a similar flower in this challenge and what I liked about it is exactly opposite in this photo. I would have preferred to see more definition between where the flowers tip''s end, but the close up makes this one work well.</td>', 'There is a similar flower in this challenge and what I liked about it is exactly opposite in this photo. I would have preferred to see more definition between where the flowers tip''s end, but the close up makes this one work well.', '2009-03-08 14:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295894, 768571, 102315, '<td valign="top">Good capture of a drop but seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Good capture of a drop but seems a bit out of focus.', '2009-03-08 14:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295899, 768016, 102315, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I am understanding what you are going for with the title. Also, would have liked to see a less textured backdrop. Is that a towel? It kinda throws my eyes off seeing that it matches the texture of the bear. Could have also not included appears to be a box in the upper right corner. I think the open space there would have been nicer in this instance. My eyes are going everywhere in the picture! I don''t know what to look at.</td>', 'I don''t think I am understanding what you are going for with the title. Also, would have liked to see a less textured backdrop. Is that a towel? It kinda throws my eyes off seeing that it matches the texture of the bear. Could have also not included appears to be a box in the upper right corner. I think the open space there would have been nicer in this instance. My eyes are going everywhere in the picture! I don''t know what to look at.', '2009-03-08 14:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295903, 769596, 102315, '<td valign="top">Too many drap colors for a white challenge for me.</td>', 'Too many drap colors for a white challenge for me.', '2009-03-08 14:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295907, 769450, 102315, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a more focused shot. Seems like a beautiful capture.</td>', 'I would have liked a more focused shot. Seems like a beautiful capture.', '2009-03-08 14:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295908, 769547, 102315, '<td valign="top">Everything is bigger in Texas.</td>', 'Everything is bigger in Texas.', '2009-03-08 14:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295911, 769326, 102315, '<td valign="top">I like the crop and how this looks like a flower.</td>', 'I like the crop and how this looks like a flower.', '2009-03-08 14:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295914, 769488, 102315, '<td valign="top">Shot''s like this are under appreciated in my opinion. Hope this one does well.</td>', 'Shot''s like this are under appreciated in my opinion. Hope this one does well.', '2009-03-08 14:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295920, 768981, 102315, '<td valign="top">I think a closer crop without the window would have been better. As far as the technical''s of the photo I would have given a 9-10. I see it an 8 though.</td>', 'I think a closer crop without the window would have been better. As far as the technical''s of the photo I would have given a 9-10. I see it an 8 though.', '2009-03-08 14:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295921, 768313, 102315, '<td valign="top">Great portrait.</td>', 'Great portrait.', '2009-03-08 14:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295924, 769530, 102315, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what your subject is. I want to look at the square and the round object at the same time but can''t. Focus and lighting or great though.</td>', 'I can''t tell what your subject is. I want to look at the square and the round object at the same time but can''t. Focus and lighting or great though.', '2009-03-08 14:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295927, 769297, 102315, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but I think you may have too many pills on hand. j/k</td>', 'I like this shot but I think you may have too many pills on hand. j/k', '2009-03-08 14:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295928, 768535, 102315, '<td valign="top">The bros. look like they just woke up.</td>', 'The bros. look like they just woke up.', '2009-03-08 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295931, 769510, 102315, '<td valign="top">Looks as if you tried very hard to get the background whiter and lost good composition in the process.</td>', 'Looks as if you tried very hard to get the background whiter and lost good composition in the process.', '2009-03-08 14:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295932, 769428, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very clean picture. I think that white is a "clean" color and soap portrays that image. Good idea.</td>', 'Very clean picture. I think that white is a "clean" color and soap portrays that image. Good idea.', '2009-03-08 14:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295936, 769501, 102315, '<td valign="top">The only way that I realized that the girl had wings is because of the title. The wings are lost in a fog that seems to dominate the image. Unless you were going for an "angel in the clouds" theme I don''t see it working with this image.</td>', 'The only way that I realized that the girl had wings is because of the title. The wings are lost in a fog that seems to dominate the image. Unless you were going for an "angel in the clouds" theme I don''t see it working with this image.', '2009-03-08 14:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295940, 769201, 102315, '<td valign="top">The human body CAN be tastefully shot.....go figure. I like her calming look. It really goes with the white as being a "pure" color image.</td>', 'The human body CAN be tastefully shot.....go figure. I like her calming look. It really goes with the white as being a "pure" color image.', '2009-03-08 14:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295942, 769587, 102315, '<td valign="top">CD''s?</td>', 'CD''s?', '2009-03-08 14:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295943, 768314, 102315, '<td valign="top">Too bright for me.</td>', 'Too bright for me.', '2009-03-08 14:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295944, 768815, 102315, '<td valign="top">Wide eyed. Very cute.</td>', 'Wide eyed. Very cute.', '2009-03-08 14:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295947, 769606, 102315, '<td valign="top">This shot distinguishes the white background and the flowers nicely.</td>', 'This shot distinguishes the white background and the flowers nicely.', '2009-03-08 14:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295951, 769373, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very clean picture. I think that white is a "clean" color and soap portrays that image. Good idea. Being a minimalist myself I like this one better than the other soap image that I''ve already voted on some far. +1</td>', 'Very clean picture. I think that white is a "clean" color and soap portrays that image. Good idea. Being a minimalist myself I like this one better than the other soap image that I''ve already voted on some far. +1', '2009-03-08 14:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295952, 768637, 102315, '<td valign="top">Like the DOF and focus of this one.</td>', 'Like the DOF and focus of this one.', '2009-03-08 14:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295955, 769500, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very cute but her smile looks forced.</td>', 'Very cute but her smile looks forced.', '2009-03-08 14:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295963, 769079, 102315, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot but why the gray in the corners of the photo? Was this in processing?</td>', 'Awesome shot but why the gray in the corners of the photo? Was this in processing?', '2009-03-08 15:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295964, 769433, 102315, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful.', '2009-03-08 15:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5295970, 769567, 102315, '<td valign="top">Great idea on the typical flower shot. Flowers as they are naturally! Flowers are not always beautiful. It''s called life.</td>', 'Great idea on the typical flower shot. Flowers as they are naturally! Flowers are not always beautiful. It''s called life.', '2009-03-08 15:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
