(5297023, 768433, 47852, '<td valign="top">Hmm... reading the other comments about folks who didn''t care for the green.  At first I thought the same thing, but then started to feel that the green shrubs gave this little guy a place to hide and added something to the scenery.  Either way, still one of my favorite shots from the challenge :)</td>', 'Hmm... reading the other comments about folks who didn''t care for the green.  At first I thought the same thing, but then started to feel that the green shrubs gave this little guy a place to hide and added something to the scenery.  Either way, still one of my favorite shots from the challenge :)', '2009-03-09 06:07:31.000000', NULL, 0),
