(5297091, 768419, 103601, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the comments! i agree, i don''t know what i was thinking with the border, and you''re right, black isn''t a light color, but i didn''t have a lot to work with. I would''ve liked to have kept the whole strap in the frame, and actually, i''m not really happy with the crop, but i was having some issues in post processing and i got frustrated.</td>', 'thanks for all the comments! i agree, i don''t know what i was thinking with the border, and you''re right, black isn''t a light color, but i didn''t have a lot to work with. I would''ve liked to have kept the whole strap in the frame, and actually, i''m not really happy with the crop, but i was having some issues in post processing and i got frustrated.', '2009-03-09 07:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
