(5889904, 769429, 101117, '<td valign="top">It was the title that actually made me open this shot up, I''ve had endless discussions with various people about the meaning of that song! But I digress.<br/> <br/>This is a great shot for the challenge, and no surprise at all that it made top ten. It''s got wonderful colours (or lack of) but what makes this shot for me is actually the green area, with what seems to be a white webbing all over it. It''s almost as if the green area is "trying" to fit in with the rest of the shot!</td>', 'It was the title that actually made me open this shot up, I''ve had endless discussions with various people about the meaning of that song! But I digress. This is a great shot for the challenge, and no surprise at all that it made top ten. It''s got wonderful colours (or lack of) but what makes this shot for me is actually the green area, with what seems to be a white webbing all over it. It''s almost as if the green area is "trying" to fit in with the rest of the shot!', '2010-03-04 07:21:29.000000', NULL, 0),
